      <h2 class="text-primary-text font-bold mb-6">
        Why Choose an Outdoor Romantic Photoshoot for Couples?
      </h2>

      <p class="text-secondary-text mb-6">
        Studio shoots have their place, but nothing beats the magic of an
        outdoor photoshoot. Being outside adds a sense of adventure and freedom
        to your session. There's room to walk, explore, and simply enjoy the
        experience together without feeling confined. Plus, nature provides the
        perfect backdrop for romantic photos, whether it's a lush park, a
        charming garden, or a scenic riverside.
      </p>

      <p class="text-secondary-text mb-12">
        For couples, being outdoors often brings out the natural chemistry
        between you. Rather than focusing on the camera, you can concentrate on
        each other, making the session feel like a relaxed day out, especially
        if we choose a location that holds special meaning for you. This allows
        for authentic, intimate moments to be captured in a way that's difficult
        to achieve indoors.
      </p>

