        incredibly flattering. And if it rains? We'll embrace it! Rain can add a
        touch of romance to your photos, with cosy shots of you and your partner
        huddled under an umbrella or running through puddles. Plus, if needed,
        we can always find a nice café or reschedule for another day if the
        weather really isn't cooperating.
