        comfortable and confident. I usually recommend avoiding overly busy
        patterns or logos, as they can distract from the connection between you
        and your partner. Instead, go for soft, neutral tones or subtle colour
        coordination. Flowy dresses, cosy jumpers, or even a tailored jacket can
        add a touch of elegance to your photos without taking away from the
        natural feel of the shoot.
      </p>

